{"reviewId": "43226754_89TOE5wM0", "review": {"abstract": "而在其后的30年里，对康波的研究一直沉寂，想来那是第四次康波的繁荣阶段。20世纪70年代之后，对康波的研究再度活跃，而这肯定源于第四次康波进入了衰退和萧条阶段", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "哈哈哈，康波研究最活跃的阶段，是康波进入衰退和萧条的阶段，也是大多数人被挂住的阶段。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "1780-1859", "createTime": 1781585788, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "43226754_89TOE5wM0", "userVid": 43226754, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 43226754, "name": "编号80", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/lhew2R076fJolDWHjL8ZWC3punOib93FjIzmKBqdiaVJKpLcMTVNtD3RRk60upUDMZD51QFjvvibEOEOv8GtPo8Kt4vSRxUba3mtHplfghMMSI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "编号80", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20231009-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "亏钱阶段，能保住之前的积蓄就不错了，也到了布局复苏和繁荣的时候", "reviewId": "43226754_89TOE5wM0", "commentId": "43226754_89TOE5wM0_c223635575_8bJCQxvkH", "userVid": 223635575, "createTime": 1788050205, "author": {"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2fh6Apib2IF1Zia3MdJnpUKYzOm1Gx4bnmrskWZEUvdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isB